{%- doc -%}
The slideshow's centered logo, drawn inside one slide: between the slide's background media and its text, so the slide's heading, text and
buttons always sit in front of it instead of under it. Styles are in sections/slideshow.liquid.

@param {object} logo - the logo image (section setting "center_logo")
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- if logo != blank -%}
  <div class="slideshow__center-logo">
    {{- logo | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: sizes: '(max-width: 699px) 80vw, 40vw', widths: '200,300,400,600,800,1200', alt: shop.name -}}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
